<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-051-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Thompson (1917) Fig. 383 crocodylian skull coordinate transformations (Pass 2) — MorphoEval overall 73.0/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-28"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Full validation: 78-landmark GPA species means; cross-species similarity RMSE exceeds within-species LOO noise floor by ~40% (headline ratio 1.40) → mixed Thompson verdict; TPS shuffled-label ablation RMSE > homologous; KS p≈0.001 between within- and warped-distance distributions; specimen mask covers ~24% of frame, ~35% of aligned landmarks fall inside mask. Overall 73.0/100 (faithfulness 70.6, reproducibility 78.8); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit f1d96f32ba3f00517c53e9cd007634306cc8d4f4; environment: python 3.12, numpy 2.x, scipy 1.x, matplotlib 3.x, Pillow 10.x. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 80, Morphological realism / specimen match 58, Parameter expressivity 72, Morphometric validation 78, Source and data traceability 86, Code-to-model traceability 74, Reproducibility package 76. Output judged: docs/media/t1917_051_on_the_theory_of_transformatio_comparison.png: rendered output of thompson/claims/t1917-051_on-the-theory-of-transformations.py at f1d96f32ba3f00517c53e9cd007634306cc8d4f4, image/png, 105148 B, 1800×1200 px, artifact_sha256 99352022cff55fe59095aa3e48fc6ff0526387a6f1762a031362c49e903bcee3 (sha256 99352022cff55fe59095aa3e48fc6ff0526387a6f1762a031362c49e903bcee3), spec_fingerprint d83a1ab5f05d94feaf3f0f8e42e08bf2eef326fe6ea9418c9c49f97ae7d3bf89. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: d83a1ab5f05d94feaf3f0f8e42e08bf2eef326fe6ea9418c9c49f97ae7d3bf89; artifact_sha256: 99352022cff55fe59095aa3e48fc6ff0526387a6f1762a031362c49e903bcee3; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/thompson_1917/t1917-051/WatanabeSlice_JEB_PreGPA.nts=4ebb3bf100ef27fe..., datasets/thompson_1917/t1917-051/scout_manifest.json=7bdead2ffdf7d38c...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-28-t1917-051-on-the-theory-of-transformatio-audit." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:hasScore 7.3e-01 ;
